on exitFrame
  [  0] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  1] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  2] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  3] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  4] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  7] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  8] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  9] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 10] getglobal 35 ............................ <meetings>
  [ 13] getchunk ................................ <item 1 of meetings>
  [ 14] pushcons 0 .............................. <"done">
  [ 16] nteq .................................... <item 1 of meetings <> "done">
  [ 17] jmpifz [ 45] ............................ if item 1 of meetings <> "done" then / else
  [ 20] pushint8 10 ............................. <10>
  [ 23] pusharglist 1 ........................... <10>
  [ 25] extcall 12 .............................. <sprite(10)>
  [ 27] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 28] setobjprop 13 ........................... sprite(10).visible = 0
  [ 30] pushint8 12 ............................. <12>
  [ 33] pusharglist 1 ........................... <12>
  [ 35] extcall 12 .............................. <sprite(12)>
  [ 37] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 40] setobjprop 13 ........................... sprite(12).visible = 1
  [ 42] jmp [ 55]
  [ 45] pushint8 12 ............................. <12>
  [ 48] pusharglist 1 ........................... <12>
  [ 50] extcall 12 .............................. <sprite(12)>
  [ 52] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 53] setobjprop 13 ........................... sprite(12).visible = 0
  [ 55] ret
end
